  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In May 2001 SNAO was commissioned to prepare a feasibilitystudy of the needs in the Sector External and Internal Audit in Serbia. In August 2001 Sida received a formal request from the Finistry of Finance in the Republic of Serbia to support the creation of a Public Internal Finacila Control system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">P&#xe5; f&#xf6;rsommaren 2001 unders&#xf6;kte RRV f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r svenskt st&#xf6;d till extern och internrevision i Serbien. I augusti 2001 fick Sida en formell f&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan fr&#xe5;n det Serbiska Finansministeriet om st&#xf6;d till uppbyggnad av republikens internrevisionsfunktion. Genomf&#xf6;rda revisioner 2001 har aktualiserat Serbiens behov.</narrative>
  </description>
